# Challenge nudge

When you just proposed or finished a **non-trivial** design (architecture, HH scrape/parser, AI routing, DB schema, multi-file redesign), end with one short line:

`Могу @challenge / «поспорь» по этому решению.`

Skip if this turn already ran challenge/devils-advocate.

Canon: `.cursor/rules/challenge.mdc`, skill `devils-advocate`, `agents/CHALLENGE_PROMPTS.md`.
